%h2 Authenticate Using Additional Factor
- if rodauth.two_factor_auth_links.empty?
  %p
    You need to authenticate via an additional factor before continuing, but
    no second-factor method is currently available for this account.
  - if rodauth.otp_exists? && rodauth.otp_locked_out?
    .alert.alert-warning
      TOTP authentication is locked out after too many failed code attempts.
  %p
    To restore access, ask the operator to run
    %code rake rodauth:reset_totp_lockout
    to keep TOTP configured, or
    %code rake rodauth:disable_totp
    to fall back to password-only login. Requests from an IP listed under
    %code web.admin.allowed_ips
    in config/rubyca.yml bypass this gate entirely.
- else
  %p You need to authenticate via an additional factor before continuing.
  .d-flex.flex-column.gap-2{ style: 'max-width: 20rem' }
    - rodauth.two_factor_auth_links.each do |_, link, text|
      %a.btn.btn-primary{ href: link, role: 'button' }= text
